\begin{hint}{ex:zmzncomp}
Choose the image of $\bar1$ and impose the relation $m\bar1=0$. For a pure tensor $d\otimes t$, first choose a non-zero integer $n$ killing $t$, then divide $d$ by $n$ in $D$.
